## 8. Conclusion

A structured employee account lifecycle management process helps organisations maintain control over identities, permissions and company resources.

By coordinating HR, management and IT/Security activities, the organisation can reduce unauthorised access, protect confidential information and maintain business continuity.

This process supports the implementation of Zero Trust security principles and strengthens the organisation's overall identity and access management practices.

